  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 501.10 \"Original\" means the first filing by an owner, in a tax year, of the Form PA-38, “Notice of Intent to Excavate”, with the assessing officials in the municipality in which the excavating is to take place.\n\nSource. #7860, eff 3-31-03 (formerly Rev 501.08), EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 501.08); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
